Add Bugzilla Directory Configuration
At the bottom of httpd.conf, add:
<Directory "C:/xampp/htdocs/bugzilla">
 Options +ExecCGI
 AddHandler cgi-script .cgi
 DirectoryIndex index.cgi
 AllowOverride All
 Require all granted
</Directory>
Bugzilla's Apache documentation uses the same core settings: enable CGI execution,
set index.cgi as the directory index, and allow .htaccess overrides. (Bugzilla)
