Bugzilla installation.
For your college practical, keep it localhost-only.
My recommended installation strategy
Because there are several moving parts, don't perform all 26 steps at once.
Let's do it in these checkpoints:
Checkpoint 1: Install XAMPP → test Apache + MariaDB + Perl
Checkpoint 2: Download/extract Bugzilla
Checkpoint 3: Run checksetup.pl --check-modules
Checkpoint 4: Fix missing Perl modules
Checkpoint 5: Configure MariaDB
Checkpoint 6: Run checksetup.pl
Checkpoint 7: Configure Apache CGI
Checkpoint 8: Open Bugzilla
Checkpoint 9: Create Product/Component
Checkpoint 10: Create and track sample bugs
This approach is much safer because if something fails, we can identify exactly
which component caused it rather than trying to troubleshoot the whole installation.
